      en: ["The core of the castle was built in 1450 by Jean de Berlo.", "The fortress features four prominent corner towers with bulbous roofs.", "Baron de Rouveroy converted the fortress into a chateau in 1634.", "The site currently hosts three distinct permanent museums.", "The entire structure is surrounded by a water-filled moat.", "The castle is situated in the Calestienne limestone region of Wallonia."],
