      en: ["The current main building was constructed between 1770 and 1780.", "The facility's square keep dates back to the 12th century.", "The castle was classified as a protected monument in 1947.", "The de Schiervel family owned the estate during the 19th century.", "The surrounding park was designed in the English landscape style.", "The property is located near the historic city of Tongeren."],
