      en: ["The abbey was founded around the year 685 by Saint Berthuin.", "Augustinian canons took over the monastery in the year 1147.", "The current abbey church was constructed between 1651 and 1654.", "In 1796, the abbey was closed during the French occupation.", "Since 1841, the complex has housed a prominent Catholic school.", "The founder's relics are kept in a 17th-century ornamental shrine."],
