      en: ["The current fortress was constructed by the Dutch between 1818 and 1821.", "Visitors must climb 408 steps to reach the summit by foot.", "The citadel is located 100 meters above the water level of the Meuse river.", "Decisive World War I battles took place here in August 1914.", "The first castle on this site was established as early as the year 1040.", "Charles de Gaulle was wounded in 1914 during the fighting in Dinant."],
